   "tLinearizeR1/eulerRatesJacobianIsAnalytic"
  ],
  "rationale": "R1-L1: sign of q sin(phi) tan(theta) in phidot; invisible at wings-level trims (R1 M4)."
 },
 {
  "id": "S5LR-L2",
